    "text": "An arc of a circular loop of radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is kept in the horizontal plane and a constant magnetic field&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is applied in the vertical direction as shown in the figure. If the arc carries current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> then find the force on the arc.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0041_3b9e7fc379bf.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 188px;\" />"
